Package: secureboot-manager
Architecture: any
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, qt6-base-dev, qt6-tools-dev, qt6-l10n-tools
Description: KDE Secure Boot & MOK Management Console
 A polished graphical system utility written in C++/Qt 6 that automates 
 Machine Owner Key (MOK) tracking, automated OpenSSL bootstrap certificate 
 generation, and kernel module/driver validation interfaces.
